&lt;p&gt;The animation below runs the Time Slider along the buildings&amp;rsquo; construction year, from 1850 to 2025, so Manhattan fills in era by era. Click it to play the full-quality video.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://files.opengeos.org/nyc-buildings.webm&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
