    &gt;Open the live project&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;planetary-basemaps&#34;&gt;Planetary basemaps
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;GeoLibre is not limited to Earth. Planetary basemaps from OpenPlanetaryMap and USGS Astrogeology cover the Moon, Mars, Mercury, Venus, the Galilean moons (Io, Europa, Ganymede, Callisto), Titan, Pluto, and Charon, with a per-project ellipsoid so distance, area, and scale measurements match the body you are mapping. The deep-space starfield behind each globe comes from the Atmosphere Effects plugin.&lt;/p&gt;
