&lt;h2 id=&#34;citation&#34;&gt;Citation
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;If you use GeoLibre in your work, please cite it. GeoLibre is archived on &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://zenodo.org/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
